=== cs19: empty-intermediate chain (a always empty -> b empty) ===
== Query ==
WITH a AS (
SELECT o_custkey AS k, SUM(o_shippriority) AS s
FROM orders WHERE o_totalprice < 0 GROUP BY o_custkey),
b AS (
SELECT k, MAX(s) AS m
FROM a GROUP BY k)
SELECT k, SUM(m) FROM b GROUP BY k;

Number of output lines, including header: 0

